msgctxt "L_SHO_027"
msgid "Generator has been reactivated.\n"
msgstr "Générateur activé.\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_028"
msgid "Skedar Inner Sanctum has been reached.\n"
msgstr "Centre du sanctuaire Skedar atteint.\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_029"
msgid "Skedar secret army has been defeated.\n"
msgstr "Armée secrète Skedar détruite.\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_030"
msgid "This seems to be one of the special pillars.\n"
msgstr "Ca ressemble à un des piliers que je suis censée trouver.\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_031"
msgid ""
"The power's more constant in this area. \n"
"The Inner Sanctum can't be far away.\n"
msgstr ""
"Cette zone est plus stable. \n"
"Le sanctuaire doit être proche.\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_032"
msgid "OH, NO!!! A Skedar army in suspended animation!\n"
msgstr "OH, NON!!! Une armée skedar en animation suspendue!\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_033"
msgid ""
"Okay, this is it... Cut off the head and the \n"
"body will perish.\n"
msgstr "Très bien, il faut trancher la tête...le reste périra lentement.\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_034"
msgid ""
"This is the Skedar fanatics' most holy place. They believe this planet is "
"sacred ground. The Battle Shrine is located at the most holy part of this "
"holy planet.\n"
msgstr ""
"Voici le saint des saints des fanatiques skedars. Ils pensent que cette "
"planète est sacrée. L'Autel de Bataille est le lieu le plus vénéré de cette "
"planète.\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_035"
msgid ""
"So let me get this straight - it's holy. But there's more to it than that, "
"isn't there?\n"
msgstr ""
"Je vois. Cet endroit est sacré pour eux. Mais ce n'est pas tout, il y a "
"autre chose, n'est-ce pas?\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_036"
msgid ""
"Yes. In all of the time that we Maians fought the Skedar, we never found "
"this place. We knew that until it was destroyed, the war would never be "
"over. We fought the Skedar to a standstill, we earned a ceasefire - but we "
"always had to be on our guard. The destruction of this place would mean a "
"chance at true peace.\n"
msgstr ""
"En effet. Depuis le temps que les Maians se battent contre les Skedars, nous"
" n'avons jamais pu trouver cet endroit. Sa destruction est la clé de la "
"victoire. Nous avons combattu jusqu'à obtenir un cessez-le-feu, mais nous "
"avons toujours été sur nos gardes. La destruction de cet endroit pourra "
"enfin donner une chance à la paix.\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_037"
msgid ""
"Then we have to be certain that no fanatics survive. I'll go in and take out"
" the leader. You'll have to summon the Maian fleet to level the Shrine.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nous devons être certains qu'aucun fanatique ne survivra. Je vais m'occuper "
"du chef. Il faudra que tu prépares l'armada maian pour pulvériser ce satané "
"temple.\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_038"
msgid ""
"If you're caught on the ground when the fleet gets here, you won't stand a "
"chance.\n"
msgstr ""
"Il faudra que tu t'enfuies avant les bombardements, nous n'allons pas faire "
"dans le détail.\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_039"
msgid "That's a mistake I don't intend to make.\n"
msgstr "Je ne compte pas vraiment m'éterniser.\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_040"
msgid "Yesss...\n"
msgstr "Ouiii...\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_041"
msgid "Joanna! Joanna! \n"
msgstr "Joanna! Joanna!\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_042"
msgid "Elvis! Elvis! Over here.\n"
msgstr "Elvis! Elvis! Par ici.\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_043"
msgid "No problem. Grab my arms - we'll get you out in no time.\n"
msgstr "Pas de problème. Attrape mon bras. On va te sortir de là.\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_044"
msgid "No, quick! Give me your gun!\n"
msgstr "Non, vite! Donne-moi ton arme!\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_045"
msgid "Will! You! Just! Let! Go!\n"
msgstr "Fous le camp!\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_046"
msgid ""
"I managed to get the fleet to stop the bombardment while I looked for you. "
"They'll start as soon as we're clear.\n"
msgstr ""
"J'ai réussi à retarder le bombardement, la flotte est en attente. Ils vont "
"commencer dès que nous serons partis.\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_047"
msgid "I'd have got out in time if that one hadn't grabbed my foot.\n"
msgstr ""
"Je m'en serais tirée si ce gros lourdaud ne m'avait pas attrapé le pied.\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_048"
msgid "Of course, Joanna, of course.\n"
msgstr "J'en suis sûr, Joanna, j'en suis sûr.\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_049"
msgid "No, I would have.\n"
msgstr "Non, je te dis que je l'aurais fait.\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_050"
msgid "I believe you.\n"
msgstr "Mais je te crois.\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_051"
msgid "Make your sacrifice to the God of War.\n"
msgstr "Fais tes prières au dieu de la guerre.\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_052"
msgid "Grenade ammo used up - can't enter Shrine.\n"
msgstr "Plus de grenades - Impossible d'entrer dans le Temple.\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_053"
msgid "Alternative entrance to Shrine created.\n"
msgstr "Autre accès au Temple créé.\n"

msgctxt "L_SHO_054"
msgid "Where are you? Are you hurt?\n"
msgstr "Où es-tu? Tout va bien?\n"
